# AYRA AI — Security Notice
# API Keys are NO LONGER embedded or baked into the application build artifacts.
# All API keys (Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, xAI, Mistral, Perplexity, OpenRouter, Tavily, etc.)
# are configured by the user at runtime in the app UI and encrypted on-device via Android Keystore (AES-256-GCM).
#
# Release Signing Environment Variables (Optional for custom signing):
# RELEASE_STORE_FILE=
# RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD=
# RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=
# RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=
